Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:34:09 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 033/207] server: open the non-strict tool fallback explicitly
 under tool_choice auto

Structural tags compile argument schemas in strict mode, where an object that
omits additionalProperties is closed. The fallback for a tool that is not
strict now says additionalProperties: true, so it takes any JSON object.

zig build test-grammar-tools -Dxgrammar=DIR walks the strict lookup(q, n)
and non-strict now(tz) fixture's auto grammars through a real libtfgrammar
in DeepSeek DSML, hermes JSON and Qwen XML markup.
